request := pre.pending OR rise;
canServe := ServiceReady AND !Busy;
pending := !Cancel AND request AND !canServe;
dispatch := !Cancel AND request AND canServe.
Our Pending update: if Cancel => false; elif request&canServe => false; else request. In CANCEL false, pending = request AND NOT canServe. matches. In Cancel true, pending false. Good. But note if Cancel true and request true and canServe false, LTL pending false, dispatch false. Our false false. Good. If Cancel true and canServe true, pending false dispatch false. Good.

